Artist: ZERO CONTACT, Bryce Kenneth
Title: Captured
Label: Steyoyoke
Format: Digital
Release Date: Sept 16, 2025
Cat No: SYYK284

ZERO CONTACT and Bryce Kenneth present “Captured”, a deep dive into the darker edges of Ethereal Techno. Pulsating low-end grooves and detailed percussive layers create a hypnotic flow, pulling the listener into a shadowy and cinematic atmosphere.

Haunting vocal textures rise and fade throughout the track, adding a ghostly presence that intensifies the emotional impact. Captured is built for late-night moments where tension and beauty collide, delivering an unmistakable ethereal techno experience.

⸻


📝 *TRACKLIST*
01. ZERO CONTACT, Bryce Kenneth - Captured (Original Mix)


#etherealtechno #techno #melodictechno
