D\":\"8892d8f0-8bb0-4977-a2ae-aa5b5114fffe\"}},\"hash_used\":\"djb2\",\"user\":{\"customIDs\":{\"stableID\":\"8892d8f0-8bb0-4977-a2ae-aa5b5114fffe\"},\"country\":\"MD\",\"appVersion\":\"1758611013\",\"custom\":{\"region\":\"CU\"},\"statsigEnvironment\":{\"tier\":\"production\"}},\"recording_blocked\":true,\"can_record_session\":false,\"session_recording_rate\":1}","user":{"customIDs":{"stableID":"8892d8f0-8bb0-4977-a2ae-aa5b5114fffe"},"country":"MD","appVersion":"1758611013","custom":{"region":"CU"},"statsigEnvironment":{"tier":"production"}}}},{"hydratable":"trackingBrowserTabId","data":"22ae1e"},{"hydratable":"user","data":{"avatar_url":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/avatars-000196132065-33i1ck-large.jpg","city":"Berlin","comments_count":0,"country_code":"DE","created_at":"2011-11-14T11:07:11Z","creator_subscriptions":[{"product":{"id":"creator-pro-unlimited"}}],"creator_subscription":{"product":{"id":"creator-pro-unlimited"}},"description":"Founded by Soul Button in Berlin, Steyoyoke Recordings is a groundbreaking collective that embodies the essence of Ethereal Techno across its three distinct labels: Steyoyoke, Steyoyoke Black, and Inner Symphony. Each label brings a unique yet complementary sound, contributing to the rich and diverse tapestry of the Steyoyoke brand. Steyoyoke, the flagship label launched in 2012, is renowned for its innovative Ethereal Techno sound, characterized by deep, emotive melodies, and intricate production. This label has set a high standard in the electronic music scene with its commitment to blending music and art, offering listeners a deeply immersive experience.\n\nIn 2014, Steyoyoke Black was introduced, carving a niche for darker, more techno-driven sounds. This sub-label maintains the emotive and atmospheric qualities of Ethereal Techno while exploring the deeper, more mysterious facets of the genre. Inner Symphony, established in 2017, began as a podcast series before evolving into a full-fledged label. It focuses on creating profound, emotive, and uplifting music, characterized by deep and atmospheric melodies. Inner Symphony aims to offer a curated music experience that resonates deeply with the mind, body, and spirit.\n\nTogether, Steyoyoke, Steyoyoke Black, and Inner Symphony form a cohesive project dedicated to discovering and nurturing forward-thinking musicians. This project consistently delivers quality productions that resonate globally, remaining a beacon for those seeking deeply emotional and introspective musical journeys. The Steyoyoke Recordings collective stays true to its ethos of blending art and sound, creating harmonious and enriching experiences for its audience. The labels’ roster includes Soul Button, Nick Devon, Monarke, MPathy, Clawz SG, Mashk, René Diehl, Binaryh, Furkan Cinar, and Santiago Celasso, all of whom contribute to its mission of delivering high-quality, emotionally rich productions.","followers_count":103140,"followings_count":7,"first_name":"Ethereal Techno","full_name":"Ethereal Techno","groups_count":0,"id":8927023,"kind":"user","last_modified":"2025-09-23T13:43:49Z","last_name":"","likes_count":2011,"playlist_likes_count":505,"permalink":"steyoyoke","permalink_url":"https://soundcloud.com/steyoyoke","playlist_count":417,"reposts_count":null,"track_count":1836,"uri":"https://api.soundcloud.com/users/soundcloud%3Ausers%3A8927023","urn":"soundcloud:users:8927023","username":"STEYOYOKE","verified":true,"visuals":{"urn":"soundcloud:users:8927023","enabled":true,"visuals":[{"urn":"soundcloud:visuals:250459101","entry_time":0,"visual_url":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/visuals-000008927023-ODmudT-original.jpg"}],"tracking":null},"badges":{"pro":false,"creator_mid_tier":false,"pro_unlimited":true,"verified":true},"station_urn":"soundcloud:system-playlists:artist-stations:8927023","station_permalink":"artist-stations:8927023","date_of_birth":null,"url":"/steyoyoke"}},{"hydratable":"sound","data":{"artwork_url":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/artworks-GKBEaNJeM7q7ELUT-ySHFCg-large.jpg","caption":null,"commentable":true,"comment_count":9,"created_at":"2025-08-21T18:26:35Z","description":"🗯️ Join the Steyoyoke Community Whatsapp Channel: https://syykrec.com/whatsapp\n✅ Join the SYYK community and stay connected: https://syykrec.com/joinsteyoyoke\n🛍️ Check out the new merch available on the Steyoyoke Shop: https://www.steyoyoke.com/shop/clothing/\n✅ Subscribe to the Steyoyoke Youtube channel: https://syykrec.com/add_steyoyoketv\n✅ Subscribe to the Steyoyoke Sounds Spotify playlist: https://syykrec.com/steyoyokesounds\n\n__________________________________________\n\n👕 Follow SYYK Berlin, the sleek collection of Steyoyoke Clothing inspired by Berlin's vibrant techno scene, featuring premium, eco-organic quality materials:\nhttps://www.instagram.com/syykberlin/\n\n__________________________________________\n\n📱  Listen on the Steyoyoke APP : https://steyoyoke.com/share?type=track\u0026release_id=613\u0026title=Captured\n\n🛒 *Shop Merchandise*\nBUY T-SHIRT : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/syykberlin\nBUY CANVAS \u0026 POSTER : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/canvasposter\n\n🎵 *Listen \u0026 Buy*\nLISTEN \u0026 BUY : https://syykrec.com/syyk284\nBANDCAMP : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/bandcamp\nBEATPORT : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/beatport\niTUNES : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/itunes\nJUNO DOWNLOAD : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/junodownload\nTRAXSOURCE : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/traxsource\n\n🎧 *Stream Now*\nSPOTIFY : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/spotify\nAPPLE MUSIC : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/applemusic\nYOUTUBE MUSIC : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/youtubemusic\nSOUNDCLOUD : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/soundcloud\nTIDAL : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/tidal\nDEEZER : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/deezer\nAMAZON MUSIC : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/amazonmusic\nANGHAMI : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/anghami\nYOUTUBE TEASER : https://syykrec.com/syyk284/youtube\n\n🌐 *WEBSITE* : https://www.steyoyoke.com/syyk284\n\n__________________________________________\n\n*DOWNLOAD THE STEYOYOKE APP FOR ANDROID AND iOS*\n\n📱 | ► https://syykrec.com/app\niOS | ► https://syykrec.com/syykapp_apple\nAndroid | ► https://syykrec.com/syykkapp_google\n\n__________________________________________\n\nArtist: ZERO CONTACT, Bryce Kenneth\nTitle: Captured\nLabel: Steyoyoke\nFormat: Digital\nRelease Date: Sept 16, 2025\nCat No: SYYK284\n\nZERO CONTACT and Bryce Kenneth present “Captured”, a deep dive into the darker edges of Ethereal Techno. Pulsating low-end grooves and detailed percussive layers create a hypnotic flow, pulling the listener into a shadowy and cinematic atmosphere.\n\nHaunting vocal textures rise and fade throughout the track, adding a ghostly presence that intensifies the emotional impact. Captured is built for late-night moments where tension and beauty collide, delivering an unmistakable ethereal techno experience.\n\n⸻\n\n\n📝 *TRACKLIST*\n01. ZERO CONTACT, Bryce Kenneth - Captured (Original Mix)\n\n\n#etherealtechno #techno #melodictechno","downloadable":false,"download_count":0,"duration":358132,"full_duration":358139,"embeddable_by":"all","genre":"Ethereal Techno","has_downloads_left":false,"id":2157136149,"kind":"track","label_name":"Steyoyoke","last_modified":"2025-09-16T08:08:50Z","license":"all-rights-reserved","likes_count":106,"permalink":"zero-contact-bryce-kenneth-captured-steyoyoke","permalink_url":"https://soundcloud.com/steyoyoke/zero-contact-bryce-kenneth-captured-steyoyoke","playback_count":1315,"public":true,"publisher_metadata":{"id":2157136149,"urn":"soundcloud:tracks:2157136149","artist":"ZERO CONTACT, Bryce Kenneth","contains_music":true,"isrc":"QMDA72590877","explicit":false,"p_line":"2025 Steyoyoke Recordings","p_line_for_display":"℗ 2025 Steyoyoke Recordings"},"purchase_title":"LISTEN \u0026 BUY","purchase_url":"https://syykrec.com/syyk284","release_date":"2025-09-16T00:00:00Z","reposts_count":13,"secret_token":null,"sharing":"public","state":"finished","streamable":true,"tag_list":"Captured Steyoyoke \"ZERO CONTACT\" \"Bryce Kenneth\" \"Melodic Techno\" \"Ethereal Techno\"","title":"ZERO CONTACT, Bryce Kenneth - Captured (Original Mix) | Steyoyoke","uri":"https://api.soundcloud.com/tracks/soundcloud%3Atracks%3A2157136149","urn":"soundcloud:tracks:2157136149","user_id":8927023,"visuals":null,"waveform_url":"https://wave.sndcdn.com/dnBFeSrqVgpQ_m.json","display_date":"2025-09-16T08:08:50Z","media":{"transcodings":[{"url":"https://api-v2.soundcloud.com/media/soundcloud:tracks:2157136149/f2f7c97e-2967-400e-b1d1-ef9373399360/stream/hls","preset":"aac_160k","duration":358132,"snipped":false,"format":{"protocol":"hls","mime_type":"audio/mp4; codecs=\"mp4a.40.2\""},"quality":"sq","is_legacy_transcoding":false},{"url":"https://api-v2.soundcloud.com/media/soundcloud:tracks:2157136149/45689b42-a78e-490f-ba67-1c60a25b42e1/stream/hls","preset":"abr_sq","duration":358132,"snipped":false,"format":{"protocol":"hls","mime_type":"audio/mpegurl"},"quality":"sq","is_legacy_transcoding":false},{"url":"https://api-v2.soundcloud.com/media/soundcloud:tracks:2157136149/063674a6-910f-436e-b9c3-fa87b639dfa8/stream/hls","preset":"mp3_1_0","duration":358139,"snipped":false,"format":{"protocol":"hls","mime_type":"audio/mpeg"},"quality":"sq","is_legacy_transcoding":true},{"url":"https://api-v2.soundcloud.com/media/soundcloud:tracks:2157136149/063674a6-910f-436e-b9c3-fa87b639dfa8/stream/progressive","preset":"mp3_1_0","duration":358139,"snipped":false,"format":{"protocol":"progressive","mime_type":"audio/mpeg"},"quality":"sq","is_legacy_transcoding":true},{"url":"https://api-v2.soundcloud.com/media/soundcloud:tracks:2157136149/4e3cb207-210a-4268-8fb0-2c527bdd1f25/stream/hls","preset":"opus_0_0","duration":358093,"snipped":false,"format":{"protocol":"hls","mime_type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"opus\""},"quality":"sq","is_legacy_transcoding":true}]},"station_urn":"soundcloud:system-playlists:track-stations:2157136149","station_permalink":"track-stations:2157136149","track_authorization":"eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJnZW8iOiJNRCIsInN1YiI6IiIsInJpZCI6ImE2NmZjNTA3LTM2NWQtNDJlMC05YThhLWY0NjdlODM3YjU4OCIsImlhdCI6MTc1ODYzODc0NX0.XuGXZSsGvTJI2Mw9r97UuXEI_KVmv5AFN-KLwEWonHY","monetization_model":"NOT_APPLICABLE","policy":"ALLOW","user":{"avatar_url":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/avatars-000196132065-33i1ck-large.jpg","city":"Berlin","comments_count":0,"country_code":"DE","created_at":"2011-11-14T11:07:11Z","creator_subscriptions":[{"product":{"id":"creator-pro-unlimited"}}],"creator_subscription":{"product":{"id":"creator-pro-unlimited"}},"description":"Founded by Soul Button in Berlin, Steyoyoke Recordings is a groundbreaking collective that embodies the essence of Ethereal Techno across its three distinct labels: Steyoyoke, Steyoyoke Black, and Inner Symphony. Each label brings a unique yet complementary sound, contributing to the rich and diverse tapestry of the Steyoyoke brand. Steyoyoke, the flagship label launched in 2012, is renowned for its innovative Ethereal Techno sound, characterized by deep, emotive melodies, and intricate production. This label has set a high standard in the electronic music scene with its commitment to blending music and art, offering listeners a deeply immersive experience.\n\nIn 2014, Steyoyoke Black was introduced, carving a niche for darker, more techno-driven sounds. This sub-label maintains the emotive and atmospheric qualities of Ethereal Techno while exploring the deeper, more mysterious facets of the genre. Inner Symphony, established in 2017, began as a podcast series before evolving into a full-fledged label. It focuses on creating profound, emotive, and uplifting music, characterized by deep and atmospheric melodies. Inner Symphony aims to offer a curated music experience that resonates deeply with the mind, body, and spirit.\n\nTogether, Steyoyoke, Steyoyoke Black, and Inner Symphony form a cohesive project dedicated to discovering and nurturing forward-thinking musicians. This project consistently delivers quality productions that resonate globally, remaining a beacon for those seeking deeply emotional and introspective musical journeys. The Steyoyoke Recordings collective stays true to its ethos of blending art and sound, creating harmonious and enriching experiences for its audience. The labels’ roster includes Soul Button, Nick Devon, Monarke, MPathy, Clawz SG, Mashk, René Diehl, Binaryh, Furkan Cinar, and Santiago Celasso, all of whom contribute to its mission of delivering high-quality, emotionally rich productions.","followers_count":103140,"followings_count":7,"first_name":"Ethereal Techno","full_name":"Ethereal Techno","groups_count":0,"id":8927023,"kind":"user","last_modified":"2025-09-23T13:43:49Z","last_name":"","likes_count":2011,"playlist_likes_count":505,"permalink":"steyoyoke","permalink_url":"https://soundcloud.com/steyoyoke","playlist_count":417,"reposts_count":null,"track_count":1836,"uri":"https://api.soundcloud.com/users/soundcloud%3Ausers%3A8927023","urn":"soundcloud:users:8927023","username":"STEYOYOKE","verified":true,"visuals":{"urn":"soundcloud:users:8927023","enabled":true,"visuals":[{"urn":"soundcloud:visuals:250459101","entry_time":0,"visual_url":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/visuals-000008927023-ODmudT-original.jpg"}],"tracking":null},"badges":{"pro":false,"creator_mid_tier":false,"pro_unlimited":true,"verified":true},"station_urn":"soundcloud:system-playlists:artist-stations:8927023","station_permalink":"artist-stations:8927023","date_of_birth":null}}}];</script>



